# --- Godot ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor cache and reimported resources. Regenerated by `--import`; committing
# it means every machine fights over binary churn it does not need.
.godot/
# Godot 3 leftovers, harmless to ignore either way.
.import/
export.cfg
export_credentials.cfg

# --- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
/build/
*.exe
*.pck
*.zip
# The tester README is authored at docs/PLAYTEST_README.txt and copied into
# build/ at package time, so ignoring build/ does not lose it.

# --- Local notes ------------------------------------------------------------
# Working notes for this project, not part of the shipped source.
CLAUDE.md

# --- Raw asset sources ------------------------------------------------------
# Downloaded packs. Only what was copied into assets/ is ever loaded, and the
# art is generated from scripts now regardless.
assets/incoming/
assets/kenney/

# --- OS and editor junk -----------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
scratchpad/
*.log
*.tmp
